## Project Description (Informative, Not Legally Binding)

LUMO is a smart voice-controlled system designed to automate home appliances
such as lights and fans using real-time speech interaction.
The system integrates Arduino, NodeMCU (Wi-Fi), and a Python-based backend
for AI-driven voice processing, command recognition, and responses.
It supports offline voice recognition, real-time feedback via speaker or buzzer,
relay-based hardware control, and expandable data storage for logs and audio.

